<p>Main Hussain hoon<br />
Labaik Ya Hussain</p>

<p>Haan, Moula Moula Moula<br />
Jab Lashkar-e-Hussain Sar-e-Khaak So Gaya<br />
(Hussain Ya Hussain Moula) ..(2)<br />
Aur Fatima Ke Laal Ka Koi Nahi Raha<br />
Halmin Moghisona Ki Shah-e-Dee'n Ne Di Sada<br />
Goonja Fiza Main Aakhri Khutba Hussain Ka<br />
(Hussain Ya Hussain Moula) ..(6)</p>

<p>Main Nabi Ki Aankho&rsquo;n Ka Noor Hoon<br />
Main Hussain Hoon Wo Hussain Hoon<br />
Main Ali Ke Dil Ka Suroor Hoon<br />
Main Hussain Hoon Wo Hussain Hoon<br />
Meri Maan Hai Janab-e-Sayyeda<br />
Mera Bhai Hassan Dil-e-Mustafa <br />
(Meri Ham Qadam Meri Do Behan) ..(2)<br />
Mera Bhai Ghazi Qarar-e-Mann<br />
(Main Hussain Hoon Wo Hussain Hoon) ..(4)<br />
Dil-e-Fatima Ka Main Chain Hoon<br />
Main Hussain Hoon Wo Hussain Hoon<br />
Main (Hussain Ya Hussain Moula) ..(2)</p>

<p>(Main Sawar-e-Dosh-e-Rasool Hoon) ..(2)<br />
(Main Hussain Jaan-e-Butool Hoon) ..(2)<br />
Main Kalam-e-Rab Ki Misal Hoon<br />
Main Gharana-e-Lazawaal Hoon<br />
(Mujhey Naaz Apney Chaman Pe Hai) ..(2)<br />
Main Hoon Paanchwa&rsquo;n Rukn-e-Panjatan <br />
(Main Hussain Hoon Wo Hussain Hoon) ..(2)<br />
Main (Hussain Ya Hussain Moula) ..(2)</p>

<p>(Main Hussain Waris-e-Deen Hoon) ..(2)<br />
(Main Gumaa'n Nahi Main Yaqeen Hoon) ..(2)<br />
Mujhey Ishq Naam-e-Khuda Se Hay<br />
Meri Jang Ahl-e-Dagha Se Hay<br />
(Meri Zindagi Merey Rab Ki Hai) ..(2)<br />
Main Chala Hoon Ghar Se Liye Kafan<br />
(Main Hussain Hoon Wo Hussain Hoon).. (3)<br />
Dil-e-Fatima Ka Main Chain Hoon<br />
Main Hussain Hoon Wo Hussain Hoon<br />
Main (Hussain Ya Hussain Moula) ..(2)</p>

<p>(Main Hazaar Sadmey Uthha Chuka) ..(2)<br />
(Main Charagh Apney Bujha Chuka) ..(2)<br />
Main Tamam Lashkar Ga'nwa Chuka<br />
Main Zameen-e-Maqtal Saja Chuka<br />
(Lo Main Zuljanah Se Gir Gaya) ..(2)<br />
Na Hai Zee'n Pe Aur Na Zamee'n Pe Tan<br />
(Main Hussain Hoon Wo Hussain Hoon) ..(2)<br />
Main (Hussain Ya Hussain Moula) ..(2)</p>

<p>Haan, (Lo Main Nok-e-Naiza Pe Aa Gaya) ..(2)<br />
(Main Kamal-e-Maqsad Ko Paa Gaya) ..(2)<br />
Tah-e-Tegh Sajda Adaa Kiya<br />
Main Utha To Paish-e-Khuda Gaya<br />
(Hai Sada-e-Hal Min Ka Mojeza) ..(2)<br />
Hai Jahan Main Zinda Mera Sukhan<br />
(Main Hussain Hoon Wo Hussain Hoon)..(3)<br />
Dil-e-Fatima s.a Ka Main Chain Hoon<br />
Main Hussain Hoon Wo Hussain Hoon<br />
Main (Hussain Ya Hussain Moula) ..(2)</p>

<p>Haan, (Main Hussain Jaan-e-Karbala) ..(2)<br />
(Hay Yahan Ki Matti Mein Bhi Shifa) ..(2)<br />
Lo Rehan O Sarwar Karo Dua<br />
Rahe Saya Sab Per Hussain Ka<br />
(Rahe Hashr Tak Yehi Silsila) ..(2)<br />
Yehi Ik Sada Ho Zameen Zaman<br />
(Main Hussain Hoon Wo Hussain Hoon) ..(2)<br />
Main (Hussain Ya Hussain Moula)..(9)<br />
Moula Moula Moula</p>